V* alive columns through n=30: [8, 14, 20, 26]
Automaton law: n -> n+2 sends C -> C+4, hence C mod 3 advances by +1.
Therefore V* is alive every third clean step: n = 8,14,20,26,...
Equivalently n == 2 mod 6 on the even ladder.

